    "note": "Reuters DNR India: mainly English-speaking, online news users; not nationally representative; under-represents TV/print and the offline/vernacular majority. India sample n approx 2,000; no education quota applied. Only brands listed were included in the survey; not an exhaustive or ranked list. Independent/critical outlets are often actively distrusted, so low scores are not a measure of content quality.",
